    ("18.4224", "★★★★★ two high-risk generator defects found by aot difftest fixed and verified (1) ADC/SBC correct first operand 3-register uses Rn not Rd 64-bit carry chain uint64_t _t=(uint64_t)_a+(uint64_t)_b+_c carry-out _t>>32 SBC borrow _a>=_b2 _b2=_b+(1-_c) only S variants update flags non-S adc.w/sbc.w no longer clobber APSR ADC/SBC S-flags inline N/Z/C/V incl correct V (a^r)&(b2^r); (2) IT-block conditional execution works _gen_split.py gained emit_cond() uses capstone effective per-instruction condition ins.cc EQ=1..LE=14 AL=15 wraps emitted statement list in if (cond_x(s)) { ... } it emits nothing first attempt returned STRING instead of list emit() returns produced char-interleaved garbage corrected to one-element list; REGENERATION py -3 _gen_split.py 500 4 compiled 26/26 ok in 417.0s 26 batch files 666,045 lines total obj 66,733,195 B; VERIFICATION aot_difftest.py now PASS=240 WARN=12 KNOWN=12 FAIL=0 previously PASS=235 WARN=12 KNOWN=17 FAIL=0 5 of 17 known generator defects gone KNOWN 17->12 PASS +5 remaining WARNs C/V flag-only deviations shift-carry not propagated V cleared non-fatal; REGRESSION RUN new batch objects hybrid boot + R5HOIST 100M exit=0 BADMEM=0 GXM=12 init all 1 asserts=0 124s generator fix no regression post-boot stall unchanged pc=00000000 blk=81206832 sp=A0E00008 fib=848367C0 PCRING 8120682A 81206832 repeating framectr=0 stall scheduler/context issue not instruction semantics; NEXT chase post-boot stall pc=0 blk=81206832 guest returned zero next-pc inside FUN_812067a0 canary path / fiber return instrument fiber return path 0x812B1B60 ReturnToThread 0x811E5CDA callback pc=0 handling and 8120682A/81206832 pair why execution cannot advance."),
    ("18.4223", "★★★★★ first clean 100M run with GXM preserved hybrid boot P5D_NESTED_UNTIL=1500000 then pure deferral + new R5HOIST guard every dispatch loop restore stack-canary pointer r5=0x812B414C when block 0x8120682A dispatched with r5=0 18.4223 gives 100M exit=0 BADMEM=0 GXM=12 init counts all 1 asserts=0 30M=45s 100M=129s crash blocked every run since M671 gone; REMAINING STALL run spins scheduler epilogue pair PCRING 8120682A 81206832 repeated FRAMEDUMP pc=00000000 blk=81206832 sp=A0E00008 fib=848367C0 framectr=0 no forward progress after boot likely fiber return/pc=0 path next target; TEAM all three workstreams complete task-1 gxm-abi 100/100 CSV mapped dispatch table typed/stub/RAW/stack-arg compile exit=0 published task-3 release-ci CI+MIT LICENSE pushed task-2 aot-difftest delivered tools/aot_difftest.py + tests/ 88 golden cases + 52 real production blocks PASS=235 WARN=12 KNOWN=17 FAIL=0 Python model vs Unicorn 88/88 generated blocks vs Unicorn 36/36 --strict exit 1 proves regression detection; differential tests found 3 REAL generator defects (1) ADC/SBC 3-register form uses Rd instead of Rn carry chain loses 32-bit carry non-S adc.w/sbc.w wrongly update flags production blk_8105AA16 batch_004 adc.w r0,r1,r3 risk HIGH 64-bit arithmetic (2) IT blocks unconditionally expanded it becomes comment cmpeq loses condition ELF 205 it / 126 cmpeq production blk_8100AD80 cmp it eq cmpeq bne risk HIGH branch conditions (3) shift-amount semantics register shift does not take Rs[7:0] 0x108 treated as >=32 instead of shift 8 immediate LSR/ASR #32 masked to 0 no shift 4+5 cases; NEXT fix generator defects 1 and 2 in _gen_batch2.py/_gen_split.py regenerate ~410s rerun aot_difftest + hybrid 100M checkpoint then chase post-boot stall pc=0 blk=81206832."),
    ("18.4221", "★★★★ all legacy nested-exec paths now cutoff-gated yet hybrid crash unchanged and new evidence shows it is NOT a nested exec anymore; gated sceFiberGetSelf one-time PUMP fiber2 run-to-completion and periodic PUMP2 every 20000 ticks require nested_allowed 18.4221 frame-slot nested exec already if(false) disabled; hybrid 30M cutoff 1.5M identical GXM=12 BADMEM va=0 block=0x8120682A ctx in_fex=0 in_fiber_exec=1 cur=848367C0 blk=8120682A total=1891302 r5=0 r7=0; since every nested-exec entry gated in_fiber_exec=1 means faulting execution is normal fiber-world path run_guest->fiber_exec_to_completion not nested call flag reflects that path; corruption produced inside fiber_exec own fiber switching around total 1.85-1.89M scheduler epilogue 0x8120682A runs r5=0 r7=0 context belongs to different fiber or stale save; NEXT probe fiber_exec switch path around total 1.84M-1.92M fiber_save/switch target/candidate g_cur_fiber saved pc/r5/r7 per fiber catch exact context mix; earlier MSW synced switches NESTED-STOP f2 save guard cover outer loops so points at in-fiber g_fiber_switch_to handling deferred switch inside fiber_exec."),
