    ("18.4203", "★★★★★ old GXM->Vulkan backend link-ready under current toolchain: sce_gxm.cpp 86,179 B obj exit=0; vulkan_backend.cpp 300,724 B obj exit=0 with -include cmath one benign warning p5d_movie_layer_active initialized and declared extern; texture_format.cpp exit=0; address_space.cpp 51,000 B obj exit=0; link test g++ empty_main.cpp + objs -lvulkan-1 -lgdi32 -luser32 only 5 undefined symbols g_log_level p5d_guest_lr p5d_guest_reg p5d_last_exec_pc p5d_t_mark trivial globals guest debug state already exists in harness plus memory bridge; memory bridge register harness guest regions mem::register_region(0x80600000,0x4000000,gp_img+0) (0x84600000,0x8000000,gp_img+0x4000000) (0x8C600000,0x14000000,gp_img+0x10000000) (0xA0000000,0x2000000,gp_img+0x28000000) so mem::translate returns pointers our GP returns backend reads/writes live guest memory; ABI adapter harness GXM stubs call old typed functions pointer params guest VA->host via translate/GP integers pass through return->r0 _gxm_table.csv provides stub-VA<->function mapping; release compliance note all sources our own code allowed in release (unlike game data M662)"),
    ("18.4202", "★★★★★ user-imposed release compliance requirement final released exe must NOT contain any game files player imports own game dump from console like P5R Android port APK engine-only game read from user nsp/xci shaders translated on-device once into app storage; consequences recorded docs/RELEASE_COMPLIANCE.md (1) hard red lines no eboot.bin/p5d_true.elf/game-derived x86-64 code batch_*.cpp/.o/AOT output no data.cpk/vita.cpk/GFDPSP2.GSC/any GFD-GFS-GMD-CPK/usm/at9 assets no game-derived SPIR-V spv_all 4332 spv no keys/firmware (2) corrected deliverable engine executable ours game-free + player-supplied game data + locally generated caches cache/recomp one-shot AOT of user eboot local cache/shaders/*.spv one-shot GXP translation from user GFDPSP2.GSC local cache/pipelines (3) first-run Prepare flow like P5R user points at own dump engine validates never copies/redistributes then one-time local static recompilation + shader translation afterwards executes only locally generated native code execution path no codegen interpreter fallback only (4) dev-tree audit spv_all/spv_all_new/spv_2ph/rt_gxp/batch_*.cpp/batch_*.o/recomp_harness.exe/GFDPSP2.GSC/eboot.bin/p5d_true.elf/C:/dev/p5d_rom/**/p5dsrc/game/**/milestone PNGs dev-only excluded from release trees (5) NEXT tools/release_audit.py scan release tree for game magics GFS0/GSC0/GXP/CPK/USM/eboot segment signatures reject built-in/local one-shot AOT tooling decision embed codegen emits machine code directly vs ship compiler toolchain compliance stage added run_all_regressions"),
