    ("18.4181", "★★★★★ stall was indirect-miss on four functions missing from function_bounds.json - adding them makes 8M run complete in 18s ZERO BADMEM no freeze: traced [HARNESS] indirect miss at pc=811E5C98 to callback trampoline 0x811E5C98 callback table 0x81513DD4..0x81513DE8 = 81182C57/8118307B/81182F6B/8118308B/811830C9/81182F1D invoked entry 0x8118308B Thumb pointer of function 0x8118308A NO translated block; same 0x81182F1C 0x81182F6A 0x8118307A real functions push prologues reached only indirectly; FIX appended 4 entries function_bounds.json 0x81182F1C size 0x4E 0x81182F6A size 0x110 0x8118307A size 0x10 state==3 predicate ldrsh r0,[r0,4] cmp r0,3 beq->1 else 0 0x8118308A size 0x3E canary-framed wait/lock helper regenerated all 26 batches 26/26 ok 412s; RESULT indirect miss GONE 8M exit=0 18s ZERO BADMEM no [HARNESS] break FRAMEDUMP advances all 8,000,000 blocks before froze 441,918/644,226 YMAIN=8 THR=20 flags=00000002; frame counter still 0 GXM=12 end-of-run trace still fiber scheduler loops pc=812067E8/812067A0/81198BF2 fib=848367C0 boot/load/scheduler phase now stable remaining work enter frame loop"),
