    ("18.4175", "★★★ write-instrumentation result [obj+4] <- obj+0x2C write seen at n=20001 does NOT go through guest wr32 path - wr32_watch range filter over 0x85003D50..0x85003DF0 saw ZERO guest writes in 3M blocks so store comes from harness/HLE code writing guest memory directly via GP(): added [OBJW] range watch inside wr32_watch g_watch_on already 1 from prelude for 160-byte calloc object range; RESULT [OBJW] never fires while main-loop watcher reports [WWRITE] block=812067C8 old=00000000 new=85003D7C n=20001 addr=85003D54; conclusion value 0x85003D7C = object+0x2C written by non-guest host-side code path touching guest address space directly allocation bookkeeping / HLE helper std::memcpy through GP not translated game code; dynamic-watch patcher failed due Python format-string bug %08X inside string later formatted with % recurring tooling pitfall patches must use .replace() not %-formatting; 3M exit=0 ZERO BADMEM GXM=12 frames=0 wall 109s baseline 30s accumulated instrumentation trim probes before performance conclusions; NEXT grep harness host-side writes [obj+4]=obj+0x2C / GP-direct list init fiber/queue HLE helpers identify routine responsible 0x85003D50 object use .replace()-patch dynamic wr32-range watch on real wait object address at W8C8 entry"),
