    ("18.4170", "★★★★★ two bugs fixed blocking fiber2: (1) ldrex/strex memory-operand emission silently dropped in generator (infinite spin loop at 0x81207290) (2) SceLibc calloc HLE 0x812B23E0 NID 0xE7EC3D0B unimplemented returned 0 game dereferenced [0+0x98]; AFTER fixes 3M and 8M runs exit=0 ZERO BADMEM game progresses deep into render/GxModel init: generated block blk_81207290 only did r2=r1+1 cmp r3,#0 bne - ldrex at 0x81207290 strex at 0x81207296 dropped because memory operand made isr(1)/isr(2) fail so r3 strex status kept old non-zero retry loop never exits 10M stuck pc=0x81207290 FIX _gen_batch2.py ldrex Rt,[Rn] uses ops[1].MEM.base strex Rd,Rt,[Rn] uses ops[2].MEM.base generated code now s->r[1]=rd32(s,s->r[0]) r2=r1+1 wr32(s,s->r[0],r2) s->r[3]=0 cmp bne loop exits; (2) [NX9A] r0=00000000 ring 811E6A28 812B23E0 811E6A2E crash block 0x81182C9A wr32(s,s->r[5]+0x98) r5=0 docs 0x812B23E0 SceLibc NID 0xE7EC3D0B call site n=1 sz=0x200 / n=0x160 sz=1 calloc implemented HLE case calloc nmemb*size hle_malloc zeroed RESULT [CALLOC] n=160 sz=1 -> 85003D50 n=1 sz=200 -> 85003DF0 3M exit=0 30s zero BADMEM 8M exit=0 30s zero BADMEM; fiber2 trace reaches pc=811830CC pc=8120760C last_block=0x812B2A50 render/GxModel construction fiber-manager region; frame counter [0x816CC630+0xC] still 0 startup/render init running GXM=12; NEXT identify HLE 0x812B2A50 continue unblocking GxModel/render setup until fiber2 reaches frame loop body"),
    ("18.4169", "★★★★★ cooperative yield implemented at sceKernelCheckCallback 0x812B2AC0 - fiber2 now dispatched and runs (previously never); progresses into thread-manager/atomic region 0x81207290 but still not frame-body counter: fiber1 lifecycle loop 0x81198BE8 has exactly one HLE call blx 0x812B2AC0 sceKernelCheckCallback only safe cooperative yield point; implemented HLE case 0x812B2AC0 when g_in_fex>0 && g_in_fiber_exec && !g_fiber_switch_to && g_fiber_list.size()>1 pick next fiber round-robin set g_fiber_switch_to fiber_exec loop top fiber_save switch at clean HLE boundary; RESULT [YIELD] from=848367C0 to=84846860 repeats 3M exit=0 6s ZERO BADMEM RESTART2=0 trace ends inside fiber2 pc=81207290 last_block=81207290 sp=A05FFD08 r0=84CDE4A4 executing own stack thread-manager region; 0x81207290 atomic-increment helper ldrex r1,[r0] adds r2,r1,#1 strex r3,r2,[r0] used by thread/subsystem creation; frame-body counter [0x816CC630+0xC] still 0 after 3M GXM=12 fiber2 still startup/thread-creation phase not render loop body; NEXT trace fiber2 thread-creation calls 0x81207xxx CreateThread/StartThread HLE satisfy wait follows them sema/eventflag HLE returns low positive SIDs never signalled so fiber2 exits init reaches frame counter increment first GXM draw call"),
    ("18.4168", "★★★★ SLICE evidence fiber2 frame loop actually runs 30001 blocks reaches delay/wait routine pc=0x8127C0F4 r0=0x2710 r1=0x3E8 lr=0x8127B950 - but arbitrary-block slicing unsafe resume mid-HLE crashes scheduler 0x8120682A va=0 reverted stable state restored: 30000-block slice budget [SLICEOUT] fiber=84846860 pc=8127C0F4 r0=00002710 r1=000003E8 r4=00000003 r5=00000000 r6=816A0B64 r7=812B414C sp=A05FFC10 lr=8127B950 after=30001 frame loop executes real code until enters 0x8127Bxxx thread/worker-manager area 0x8127BF18 worker creator r0=10000 r1=1000 delay/retry-style args slice yields middle of HLE path; resume fiber inconsistent mid-call state dies [BADMEM] guest va=0x00000000 unmapped block=0x8120682A fiber scheduler; reverted slice g_fex_budget=0 stable state 3M exit=0 ZERO BADMEM RESTART2=0 GXM=12 FRAMECTR 600 lines frames stay 0; NEXT replace arbitrary-block slicing with COOPERATIVE yielding through game scheduler implement fiber run queue semantics sceFiberGetSelf returns real current fiber app-run loop sceFiberSwitch(head) dispatches next fiber re-entry restores saved context at HLE boundary so fiber2 frame loop advances frame-by-frame without mid-HLE resume"),
