    ("18.4104", "★★★ static recompilation stage 6m9: [manager+0xC] CALLED WITH THREE DIFFERENT OPCODES (0,2,4) SO MUST BE MULTI-OPCODE DISPATCHER NOT SINGLE-OPCODE CALLBACK 0x8116F3C6: full argument-flow disasm 0x810164F4 r5=manager; r4=ID; r6=[r5+8]; bl 0x81016404(manager,ID); if result!=0 bl 0x810168A6(manager,[manager+8],result); r6=[r5+0xC]; if r6: r0=2 r1=manager r2=result r3=0; blx r6 opcode=2; 0x81016404 r3=[manager+0xC]; if r3: r0=4 r1=0 r2=0; blx r3 opcode=4; creation helper blx callback r0=0 opcode=0; so slot expected handle AT LEAST opcodes 0 2 4 but stored 0x8116F3C6 only handles opcode 3 rejects everything else; CONCLUSION value must be DIFFERENT multi-opcode dispatcher function; single-opcode callback 0x8116F3C6 likely specialized handler for another object/type; NEXT scan 0x8116F4xx region for functions testing r0 against multiple small opcodes (2/4) - one probably real dispatcher should be stored [manager+0xC]"),
