    ("18.4094", "★★★ static recompilation stage 6lz: DECISIVE ARRAY-APPEND REGISTRATION FUNCTION 0x8115D1D0 NEVER CALLED IN WHOLE 10M RUN: instrumented entry reran 10M probe count ZERO BADMEM unchanged va=0x0000000C block=0x81016836; proves game NEVER registers any object through this mechanism whole run - registry array never appended; combined earlier findings 0x81184776 dead code 0x8101949C/0x81184776 probes 0 ENTIRE registration chain dead in our environment 0x81184776 -> 0x8117306A -> 0x8115D1D0 never executes; therefore (a) real registration supposed done by HLE/system-init path not implemented (object creation inside sceAppUtil/sceSysmem init) or (b) earlier boot step wires up this system skipped so code WOULD call append never runs or (c) manager object should never be looked up here and our run reaches this code because earlier mis-dispatch; NEXT list EVERY direct caller of 0x8115D1D0 (grep return 0x8115D1D0) check all sit in same dead 0x8117xxx cluster; instrument HLE init calls (sceAppUtilInit etc.) and manager creation see surrounding boot layer progressing"),
