    ("18.3986", "static recompilation stage 6ip: located pump-restore code (lines 1447-1450: memcpy(s.r, f1 ctx) + [SEQ] restore_f1_r15 + g_cur_fiber=f1; g_pumping2=0; [PMP2] pass; end pump block); IMMEDIATELY AFTER is if (!fn) NOFN branch (1451-1485) using pc and able to rebuild/resume fiber (1481 pc=rnxt; g_after_nofn=20; continue); so pc overwrite 0x812067B6 -> 0x811E5CE8 happens either (a) main-loop header pc=s.r[15] with stale fn, (b) NOFN resume path setting s.r/PC from rebuilt FCtx (entry 0x81206BDC loader chain), or (c) [AFTER] echoing old pc; NEXT read run_guest loop header (while + pc/fn init) and [AFTER] print site which pc dispatched after pump, then fix restore so after g_pumping2=0 loop re-reads pc from restored fiber1 (0x812067B6) and does NOT fall into NOFN resume/rebuild"),
