    ("18.3968", "MILESTONE AUDIT: AOT 100% (15629->0), fs/mem usable, fiber ~40% hack-heavy, GXM/render 0% (5+5 stubs of 100, no Vulkan/shader/texture/display), audio 0%, input stubs, video 0%, game logic early-init with BADMEM 0x94 unresolved and NEVER reached S0_LOGO, scenes 0/7, packaging 0% -> OVERALL ~20-25%; ANTI-FORGETTING works for knowledge (0x81555E98 hit M241; HLE 0x812B2910 hit M142) but NOT for operation-level repeats (R1-R8: address 5-typo 2x, wrong 0x8120732Cu of 8 2x, stack-offset window 2x, missing run_guest copy 3x, mixed ring 2x, print limit 1x, watch range 2x, out-of-scope insert 3x); ACTION created docs/P5D_OPERATION_CHECKLIST.md + R1-R8 registry; NEXT keep BADMEM 0x94 hunt + START GXM->Vulkan minimal pipeline in parallel"),
    ("18.3967", "static recompilation stage 6i7: added fiber2-stack-range change watch (16 words before every run_guest block; window 0x811DA554->0x8120732C; ranges A05FF000..A05FF03C and A05FFF00..A05FFF3C covering [sp+14]=0xA05FFF2C); BOTH ZERO [STKRANGE] -> slot already held 0x81555E98 when armed (write before 0x811DA554) OR write outside run_guest window (fiber_exec / inside one block); next make check GLOBAL in BOTH loops (no window, capped prints) or arm much earlier"),
