    ("18.3958", "static recompilation stage 6hy: D72C offset-fix patch located WRONG if((pc&~1u)==0x8120732Cu) occurrence outside dispatch scope -> compile errors pc not declared (886/890/891); ROLLED BACK recomp_harness.cpp to tools_backup/recomp_harness_3957.cpp (relink OK, 3M known state); next replace the two D72C blocks by LINE NUMBER/exact dispatch text inside loop scope, re-dump [sp+0xC]..[sp+0x18]+lr+prev block"),
    ("18.3957", "static recompilation stage 6hx: D308/D72C abnormal-lr filter now on BOTH copies - first 3 0x81207308 calls normal (lr=81198EA4/AC/BC), NO abnormal-lr call in 3M -> not entered with lr=0x81555E98; added [SLOTCLOB] return-address-slot (sp-4) watch from 0x81207308 to 0x8120732C -> ZERO clobber lines (slot not overwritten); corrupted-slot assumption unsupported; most likely my [D72C] offsets wrong: epilogue add sp,#0xc; pop {r4,r5,pc} -> popped words [sp+0xC]/[sp+0x10]/[sp+0x14], my window -4..+0x10 missed [sp+0x14]; next re-dump +0xC/+0x10/+0x14/+0x18 plus prev block"),
    ("18.3956", "static recompilation stage 6hw: instrumented 0x81207308 entry + 0x8120732C stack window; first 10 hits all NORMAL loader calls ([D308] lr=81198EA4/AC/BC/C4/CC/D4 sp=82EFFE68 r0=816CC6xx; [D72C] [sp+4]=812B4150 [sp+8]=00010000 data-like); anomalous lr=0x81555E98 not in first 10; PATCH BUG: only fiber_exec (s->) copy got abnormal-lr filter, run_guest (s.) copy unfiltered; next filter both copies for lr outside [0x81000000,0x812B3000) and re-run 3M"),
    ("18.3955", "★ static recompilation stage 6hv: [SEQ] ordering shows NOFN fires BEFORE pump (#1 nofn pc=81555E98 #2 pump_start #3 save_f2_r15=0 #4 restore_f1_r15=812067B6) - pump not involved (M414 patch no-op explained); BADMEM follows fiber1 restore; run_guest pre-ring at NOFN: 812B2250 811E6A1E 811DA55A 8115D20E 8115D1FE 8115D7CC 8120732C 81555E98 -> 0x8120732C pop {r4,r5,pc} produces pc=0x81555E98; stack math: [S-4] should hold 0x81207314 (lr pushed by 0x81207308) but holds 0x81555E98 -> 0x81207308 entered with lr=0x81555E98 or slot overwritten; next watch 0x81207308 entry (lr/sp) + dump stack at 0x8120732C"),
