    ("18.3953", "★ static recompilation stage 6ht: 0x81555E98 source chain CLOSED - gbn_back(0) returns 0 (mutation hypothesis ruled out); run_guest context shows fiber2 pump does if(nx==0||nx==0xFFFFFFF0){s.r[15]=0;break;} s.r[15]=nx; then main loop NOFN prints pc -> 0x81555E98 is the fiber2 TASK-COMPLETION RETURN VALUE (nx) stored into s.r[15]; NOFN resumes fiber1 = NORMAL fiber2-task-completion/frame-end, NOT stack clobber; next: clean fiber2-completion branch (add nx==0x81555E98 to pump condition), verify per-frame loop, focus on real BADMEM 0x94/0x812067B6 crash"),
